WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier and welcome to Blameless.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.840
It's a free horror game available on Steam that supposedly is very good.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.620
But I say that for a lot of these games.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:12.520
Narrator/Character: I am an architect. Freelance, so I take job offers as they arise.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:16.920
So, when this guy called me, I was relieved I could finally get a paying job.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.720
He said he needed help with interior design for his house that he was building.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:26.600
I've always respected people who can do construction, so I naturally agreed to come and take a look.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.140
I already had a couple of ideas.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:34.460
It was already quite late but he insisted on me coming over the same day.

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:38.520
I tried to comply because I didn't want to lose this offer.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.000
I drove there with my car.

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:48.860
His house was all the way over in the suburban area. Quite remote, but with other houses nearby. Quiet place.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:51.140
The man met me at the front gate.

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:55.180
It was a temporary fence and the gate was made of rotting wooden planks.

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.420
He started showing me around the yard.

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:01.140
It seemed weird that there was a large garbage container blocking the way.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.820
So we had to go through the garage to get inside the house.

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:07.540
He took me through the rooms, so I started looking around.

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:12.220
At one point I saw a stain and at first glance it seemed like brick dust.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:16.020
But then I realized it was blood, spilled on the floor.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:16.960
Mark: Mmmmm.

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:21.100
Character: I thought that maybe there was another worker who got injured, so I turned to tell the man.

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:25.080
That's when I saw his hand raised to hit me. (Mark: Oh.) He was holding a metal rod.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:28.700
Mark: Oh. 
Character: Before I could defend myself, he hit me in the head.

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:32.660
Mark: Oh geez. 
Character: I must have passed out and I don't know how long I was out.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:35.220
*Character sighs*

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:37.720
When I... woke up...

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:41.880
