00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:50.300
Maybe you should be a little more concerned to the fact that someone tried to murder you.

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:54.460
Or maybe it was your own blood and you're just seeing it in the future. Oh, this looks lovely.

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.180
Oh this loo--uh.

00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:01.500
♪ I can't move my mouse anymore! ♪ Ooooh, there we go, okay.

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:05.400
