00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:27.980
Detective Conlin: Mr. Malcolm, we searched the yard thoroughly and didn't find any evidence suggesting there was another man.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:31.900
Garrett: No, no, no, no. He was there. He was the owner who called me.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:39.000
