00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:23.380
I have to say that I honestly don't believe any part of your bullshit story that you're giving me, here!

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:26.160
Everything suggests that you murdered that woman.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:26.880
